# Intentionally empty.
#
# RG35XX SP v1 ships the mainline sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-sp.dts as-is, so
# it needs no panel firmware blob. The H700 generic `panel-mipi-dpi-spi` driver
# and its CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE panel entries are only needed by the v2 panel
# variant, which we do not support.
#
# All firmware for this board therefore comes from alpine/boards/common/firmware
# (Realtek wifi/bt blobs + wireless-regdb), listed in tiny-base.config.
#
# The directory is kept because the kernel build points
# CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR at it. check-boards.sh skips dotfiles, so this does
# not register as an orphan blob.
